// Disable System Firewall | T1686 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/linux/auditd/service_stop/lnx_auditd_disable_system_firewall.yml
type:SERVICE_STOP AND (unit:(firewalld OR iptables OR ufw))

